  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Additional Emergency Grant Aid in Response to the Earthquake in Syria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under this project, IOM is contributing to lifesaving and life-sustaining activities by providing humanitarian assistance to internally displaced persons (IDPs) and the most vulnerable earthquake-affected populations inside northwest Syria (NWS), supporting crisis-affected groups with emergency non-food items (NFI).</narrative>
  </description>
